      "title": "Alternative Synthesizer: Escaping the False Binary",
      "prompt": "When presented with a fork in the road, our cognitive default is to choose path A or path B. Design a radical 'Option C' by deliberately merging incompatible strengths of both paths, or imagining that both A and B are legally banned. What hidden pathways emerge when standard avenues are blocked?",
      "placeholder": "Draft three unconventional alternatives that defy binary choice..."
