      "title": "Consequence Matrix: Tracing Downstream Ripples",
      "prompt": "Every choice triggers an unseen chain reaction across multiple dimensions. Select your top candidate alternative and audit its downstream ripples across time, energy, reputation, and autonomy. Where might a short-term win quietly harvest long-term debt?",
      "placeholder": "Map the 1st, 2nd, and 3rd-order consequences across all key criteria..."
