      "chapterOrder": 7,
      "title": "Risk Tolerance Calibration: Identifying Your Ruin Threshold",
      "prompt": "Risk aversion fluctuates with emotional temperature rather than cold logic. In an upcoming high-stakes choice, what is the absolute worst-case scenario? If that nightmare materialized, what would day two look like? Is your hesitation rooted in existential risk or mere reputational discomfort?",
